HELLO V1 GAME "Rules" PROTO 1
VIEW LOGICAL_W 1024 LOGICAL_H 576 TILE_W 32 TILE_H 32

CLS
BG 249 207 177 255

FONT_LOAD 1 "assets/AtkinsonHyperlegible-Regular.ttf" 64
FONT_LOAD 2 "assets/AtkinsonHyperlegible-Bold.ttf"    64
FONT_USE  1

FONT_COLOR 66 130 150 255         
FONT_SIZE 72
TEXT_ALIGN CENTER
TEXT 512 30 "RULES"

FONT_COLOR 0 0 0 255
FONT_SIZE 22
TEXT_ALIGN CENTER
TEXT 512 100 "1. Players will begin on opposite sides of the map, determining their own path."
TEXT 512 120 "2. All battles are PVE until the last. The final battle is a faceoff of both players." 
TEXT 512 140 "3. Players will take turns in movement and battle phases. Victory gains resources." 
TEXT 512 160 "4. Players will accumulate cards from battles if victorious. These cards can be used once." 
TEXT 512 180 "5. Cards may be saved for the final battle or used fighting NPCs for higher value cards." 
TEXT 512 200 "6. Cards include boosts to attack, defense, and health."  
TEXT 512 220 "7. Take turns attacking an NPC with or without cards."
TEXT 512 240 "8. As the game progresses, NPC stats will raise." 
TEXT 512 260 "9. After X# turns, the final battle shall begin." 
TEXT 512 280 "10. The winner is the one who takes down the opponents LPs first." 
TEXT 512 300 "11. Each Player begins with 10 in att, def, and HP." 
TEXT 512 320 "12. Cards are used to enhance this. This is a turn based game with weaknesses and strengths."
TEXT 512 340 "13. Melee > Ranged, Magic > Melee, Ranged > Magic."
TEXT 512 360 "14. Depending on your entity, attack or defense cards are permanent. HP cards are always"
TEXT 512 380 "    permanent. Be wise and save the cards you need the most."

FONT_USE 1
FONT_COLOR 0 0 255 255
FONT_SIZE 30
TEXT 890 545 "Press B to return"
FLIP 1